COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_POINT_TRANSACTION.UPDATETYPE IS 'Type of update performed on the record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN FACT_POINT_TRANSACTION.USERCODE IS 'Identifier of the user or system that initiated the transaction.';


